#LibreFranklin-Regular-72\" transform=\"translate(408.328125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(463.03125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(486.9375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(538.140625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6c\" transform=\"translate(562.046875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" transform=\"translate(599.453125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(659.359375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(696.65625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-be\" transform=\"translate(747.859375 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"patch_10\"><path d=\"M 155.09425 18.128 L 171.09425 18.128 L 171.09425 12.528 L 155.09425 12.528 z\n\" style=\"fill: #c2410c\"/></g><g id=\"text_15\"><g transform=\"translate(177.49425 18.128) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-2a\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(69 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" transform=\"translate(106 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-66\" transform=\"translate(165.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" transform=\"translate(225.609375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(285.515625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-48\" transform=\"translate(336.71875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-46\" transform=\"translate(394.8125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a5\" transform=\"translate(454.71875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-bd\" transform=\"translate(476.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-59\" transform=\"translate(504.71875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a5\" transform=\"translate(561.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-72\" transform=\"translate(582.53125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(637.234375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(661.140625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(712.34375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6c\" transform=\"translate(736.25 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" transform=\"translate(773.65625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(833.5625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(870.859375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-be\" transform=\"translate(922.0625 0)\"/></g></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p03382624ef\"><rect x=\"47.378\" y=\"27.296\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"133.056\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Visitors by time slot (k)","note":null},"answer":"<p>Today: 900k × ($18 − $3) = <b>$13.50M</b>.</p> <p>After: peak 540k → 497k at $21 margin; off-peak 360k → 414k at $11 margin.</p> <p>Contribution: <b>$14.99M</b> (+$1.49M, 11%). Visitors: <b>911k</b> (+11k).</p> <p><b>So-what:</b> more income, slightly more visitors, and 43k fewer people in the weekend queues. It meets the city's conditions.</p>"},{"q":"Critics say $24 shuts out families. How would you protect access?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li>Keep <b>free first Sundays</b> for residents, with timed booking so they don't queue</li> <li><b>Under-18s free</b> and student tickets at the off-peak price at any time</li> <li>A <b>resident annual pass</b> (e.g. $30) valid at any time</li> <li>Publish the income raised and the restorations it pays for</li></ul>"},{"q":"What would make you less confident in the forecast?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li>Off-peak growth may come mainly from people switching days, not new visitors: income still rises, but total visits might not</li> <li>Tour groups may book elsewhere if they lose flexibility</li><li>Bad weather and events shift demand between slots</li></ul> <p>Test it for a summer season before making it permanent.</p>"}],"reco":"Introduce peak and off-peak pricing: $24 at weekends and holidays, $14 on weekday mornings, in timed slots. On the research estimates, contribution rises from $13.5M to $15.0M, total visitors rise to about 911k and weekend crowding falls. Protect access with free first Sundays, free entry for under-18s and a low-cost resident pass. Risk: off-peak growth may be smaller if it's mostly people switching days. Next step: pilot for one summer season and measure visits by slot.","great":["Respects the public mission as a constraint","Calculates both income and visitor numbers","Uses price to spread demand, not just raise income","Builds in protections for access"],"id":37,"slug":"cobalt-museums"}